1
00:00:00,100 --> 00:00:04,425
Welcome back to Cloud Town, high up in the sky!

2
00:00:04,375 --> 00:00:07,273
This is Episode 33.

3
00:00:07,273 --> 00:00:10,039
Maya has a note for Eddie.

4
00:00:10,039 --> 00:00:12,553
But Eddie is not home.

5
00:00:12,553 --> 00:00:14,375
She waits.

6
00:00:14,375 --> 00:00:16,182
And waits.

7
00:00:16,182 --> 00:00:17,765
Oh no!

8
00:00:17,765 --> 00:00:20,638
The wind takes her note away.

9
00:00:20,638 --> 00:00:23,337
Here comes the letter box.

10
00:00:23,337 --> 00:00:26,382
Maya drops her notes inside.

11
00:00:26,382 --> 00:00:29,773
Red, then yellow, then blue.

12
00:00:29,773 --> 00:00:32,406
They wait in a neat line.

13
00:00:32,406 --> 00:00:34,720
Nothing blows away.

14
00:00:34,720 --> 00:00:37,486
Maya does not have to wait.

15
00:00:37,486 --> 00:00:39,614
She goes to play.

16
00:00:39,614 --> 00:00:41,742
Eddie comes home.

17
00:00:41,742 --> 00:00:44,095
He opens the flap.

18
00:00:44,095 --> 00:00:46,010
Red first.

19
00:00:46,010 --> 00:00:47,859
Then yellow.

20
00:00:47,859 --> 00:00:49,601
Then blue.

21
00:00:49,601 --> 00:00:52,393
The same order they went in.

22
00:00:52,393 --> 00:00:54,813
Every note is safe.

23
00:00:54,813 --> 00:00:57,127
Every note is read.

24
00:00:57,127 --> 00:00:59,654
That is the letter box.

25
00:00:59,654 --> 00:01:02,460
Now you know SQS!

26
00:01:02,460 --> 00:01:07,154
See you next time in Cloud Town, high up in the sky!

